nt. Minimum requirements 6+ years of customer-facing sales experience at a leading technology or payments company, with a track record of strong performance. Professional proficiency in spoken Mandarin, sufficient to lead customer discovery, product discussions, and commercial negotiations with Mandarin-speaking customers across the region. Excellent verbal and written communication skills in English. Experience building trusted adviser relationships with senior business leaders. Proven ability to build strong working relationships with cross-functional partners. A self motivated go-getter, capable of operating independently to drive meaningful business results Enthusiastic “roll up your sleeves” mentality Ability to understand complex technical requirements and develop solutions with multiple stakeholders. Experience leading complex negotiations involving bespoke commercial agreements. Comfort working in a fast-paced environment with changing requirements. A collaborative approach and willingness to share expertise and support colleagues. Thrives in a fast-paced environment and changing requirements Fastidious approach to CRM hygiene and experience utilizing thorough sales forecasting metrics on a weekly/quarterly basis and communicating them in a succinct manner Preferred qualifications 5+ years of experience selling payments or banking solutions. Experience managing a multi-market sales territory in APAC, particularly outside Australia and New Zealand. Experience adapting sales strategies to different customer needs and market conditions across the region.	{go}	\N	https://stripe.com/jobs/search?gh_jid=8323732	2026-10-31 17:29:20.438	2026-10-31 17:30:10.354	t	2026-10-31 17:30:10.35
