 and negotiate holistic multi-currency deals that bundle MCS and Currency Conversion, pricing across both products to deliver merchant value while capturing the full multi-currency management relationship for Stripe Engage C-suite and treasury stakeholders—including CFOs, Treasurers, and Engineering leaders—to articulate Stripe&#39;s multi-currency value proposition and displace competitors managing FX flows off-platform Serve as the FX and multi-currency GTM product specialist for the broader Account Executive team, partnering on complex deals and helping build repeatable sales motions Build and execute go-to-market strategies for new product segments, including pitch frameworks, displacement playbooks, and bundled pricing approaches Collaborate cross-functionally with product, treasury, and core account teams to support merchant activation, resolve deal blockers, and feed market intelligence back into product development Who you are We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement. Minimum requirements 5+ years of quota-carrying B2B sales experience in payments, fintech, or financial infrastructure Demonstrated knowledge of FX and treasury concepts across multiple geographies, including currency risk, settlement mechanics, and cross-border payment flows Experience managing complex, multi-stakeholder sales cycles involving finance and engineering leadership Track record of consultative, product-led selling with demonstrated competitive displacement wins Preferred qualifications Experience building a go-to-market motion for a new product or market segment, from initial targeting through to scaled execution Familiarity with multi-currency account products, FX management platforms, or global treasury tooling	{go}	\N	https://stripe.com/jobs/search?gh_jid=8175828	2026-10-31 17:29:20.581	2026-10-31 17:30:1