ngs done. Growth mindset is critical in being able to learn new things quickly, adapt on the fly, and operate in fast-moving startup environments that value high agency. Exceptional communication skills -- technical, go-to-market, and finance stakeholders should all feel like comfortable counterparts in conversing with you. Excitement for building and improving GTM playbooks and processes. Bonus Points Knowledge of the quote-to-cash space, including integrating with or otherwise interacting with tools like Salesforce, NetSuite, CPQs, etc. Experience as a software engineer, product manager, or in other technical roles. Experience in a pure sales role, particularly selling to technical buyers in engineering and product organizations or selling as a founding or early salesperson at a startup. Experience with logs, metrics, billing, finance, or other infrastructure or financial tooling and concepts.	{go,mongodb}	\N	https://stripe.com/jobs/search?gh_jid=8179419	2026-10-31 17:29:23.306	2026-10-31 17:30:13.052	t	2026-10-31 17:30:13.048
